      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">Edge Buffers &amp; Corner Protectors</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Insert foam edge buffers (2 cm thick) at all four corners and along the frame’s vulnerable points (fork crowns, rear triangle). These buffers prevent chipping and denting during handling, a common concern for bike transport in mulund where traffic vibrations are frequent.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
