      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Build a tailor‑made wooden crate sized to the bike’s dimensions, using 12 mm plywood with reinforced joist ribs. Line the interior walls with an extra layer of 80‑GSM bubble wrap for added shock absorption. The crate should feature ventilation slots and a sturdy lid with metal hinges for secure closure. This construction meets the standards of professional movers and packers bike transport.</p>
